SUMMARY:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs and Stories that Stir the Soul
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us for an inspiring and soulful experience with **Songs and St
 ories that Stir the Soul.**\n\nSongs with heart about people\, ideas\, and
  the search for what matters\n\nDo you appreciate?\n\n* Thoughtful songwri
 ting\n* Folk music and country storytelling\n* Life reflection and meaning
 ful lyrics\n* Songs that help us understand ourselves a little better\n\nI
 f so\, you have come to the right place :)\n\nThese are songs about ordina
 ry people\, extraordinary moments\, beautiful imagery\, and the search for
  what is real.\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time starting at 9:00 
 pm (Eastern Time)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming
 \n(Canadian Folk and Country Artist)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@SteveFlemmi
 ngSongs\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming Presents: Songs and Stories th
 at Stir the Soul**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\nSteve Flemming's songs explore the hu
 man experience through storytelling\, reflection\, imagination\, and heart
 felt observation. Drawing from folk\, country\, rock\, and singer-songwrit
 er traditions\, his work touches on themes of love\, loss\, hope\, resilie
 nce\, freedom\, social awareness\, personal growth\, spirituality\, and th
 e search for meaning. His songs often feature memorable characters\, every
 day moments\, philosophical questions\, and a deep curiosity about life an
 d human nature. Whether telling a story\, sharing a life lesson\, expressi
 ng a romantic sentiment\, or reflecting on the state of the world\, his mu
 sic seeks to inspire thought\, connection\, compassion\, and a greater app
 reciation for the journey we all share\n\n**Songs containing:**\n\n* Memor
 able characters\n* Emotional honesty\n* Genuine craftsmanship\n\n**Songs t
 hat ask the questions**\n\n* What makes a good life?\n* What makes a good 
 person?\n* What causes us to lose ourselves?\n* What helps us find ourselv
 es again?\n\n**Who is Steve Flemming?**\nSteve Flemming is a prolific folk
 -country singer-songwriter whose songs explore ordinary people\, gratitude
 \, personal reflection\, nature\, spirituality\, and the search for meanin
 g.\n\n**A little more about Steve the songwriter:**\nHis songs explore fre
 edom\, awareness\, love\, consciousness\, and the simple wisdom hidden in 
 ordinary life\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\n**Pay What You 
 Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer or pay pal to:\n*
 *steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribute is greatly ap
 preciated to help support these wonderful intimate evenings among music lo
 vers and friends\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
